sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant GH as GitHub
    participant Step as Advisor step
    participant Adv as Advisor
    participant API as GitHub REST API
    participant Core as Decision core
    participant Grid as Carbon Intensity API
    Dev->>GH: push commit
    GH->>Step: start job on runner
    Step->>Step: arrival time = UTC clock at first step
    Step->>Adv: request built from environment and event file
    Adv->>Adv: validate request, check trusted event
    Adv->>Adv: team config, opt-in, declared region must be GB
    Adv->>Adv: check hashes of policy, profile, estimator
    opt eligibility rules say the build may wait
        Adv->>API: completed runs of this workflow (read-only)
        API-->>Adv: run history
        Adv->>Adv: keep runs that finished before arrival
        Adv->>Adv: expected duration from the frozen estimator
    end
    Adv->>Core: decide(build, GB profile, frozen policy)
    Core-->>Adv: run now or defer, with reason
    opt decide() returned defer
        Adv->>Adv: team vetoes (cold start, urgency, max delay, deadline) can only give RUN NOW
    end
    Adv->>Grid: current GB intensity (display only)
    Grid-->>Adv: value or nothing
    Adv->>Adv: append audit record
    Adv-->>Step: response
    Step->>GH: Step Summary, step outputs, artifact upload
    GH-->>Dev: RUN NOW or DEFER RECOMMENDED, with reasons
    Note over GH,Core: Any failure gives a fail-safe RUN NOW. The step always exits successfully.
